Update task title, description, or priority.

Examples:
  # Update title and priority
  paso task update 42 -t "New title" -r high

  # Update description
  paso task update 42 -d "Updated description"

  # Long-form flags also supported
  paso task update 42 --title="New title" --priority=high

Usage:
  paso task update <id> [flags]

Flags:
  -d, --description string   New task description
  -j, --json                 Output in JSON format
  -r, --priority string      New priority: trivial, low, medium, high, critical
  -q, --quiet                Minimal output (ID only)
  -t, --title string         New task title
